- Card icon search (⚡card-manager.blade.php, app/Support/DashboardIcons.php) currently only
  searches the homarr-labs/dashboard-icons index (app logos). Add a second, generic icon set
  (e.g. Heroicons or similar) so non-app icons are searchable too — for link/output cards that
  aren't a specific branded service.

- Lazy-loaded cards (output/api widgets, `lazy` on `<livewire:...>` in card.blade.php) currently
  show a full skeleton placeholder for the whole card while loading. Ideally the title/icon
  would render immediately (non-lazy) and only the fetched content (output/API stats) would be
  the lazy part.

- Manage sidebar's Cards tab list (⚡card-manager.blade.php) could use a dropdown filter by
  group, alongside/instead of the existing plain-text Alpine filter.
